    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. Svelte regex js_ts.py:295-298 sees lang only as the first attribute; the Vue regex has the same gap for <script setup generic=T lang=ts> and <script type=module lang=ts>. Repro: <script context=module lang=ts> symbols come out language=javascript. v03."  # 79d5
