- op: discuss  # ebbb
  at: '2026-11-01T02:26:26Z'  # ebbb
  by: agent  # ebbb
  actor: jgstern_agent  # ebbb
  clock: 4  # ebbb
  nonce: ebbb  # ebbb
  message: "Fixed in PR #1983 (6d3d163a42 on dev). Root cause: the Svelte and Vue block regexes read lang only as the first attribute and ended the tag at a > inside a quoted value. One extractor (_extract_sfc_scripts, _script_block_lang) now reads lang from the attribute set, any order or quoting; ts/typescript get TypeScript, tsx gets TSX. Live repro on merged dev: hypergumbo survey on a fixture with <script context=\"module\" lang=\"ts\"> (A.svelte), <script setup generic=\"T extends Record<string, unknown>\" lang=\"ts\"> (D.vue) and <script type=\"module\" lang=ts> (E.vue): rc=0, every non-file symbol in all three is language typescript (before: javascript, and D.vue had no symbols). Tests: test_js_ts_sfc_script_lang.py (37 cases, 31 red before). Corpus: 21 blocks change grammar (podman-desktop 19, workadventure 1, koel 1)."  # ebbb
